# Contact API Routes - Test file
@baseURL = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@authToken = your_jwt_token_here

### Health Check
GET {{baseURL}}/contact/self

### Submit Contact Form (Authenticated User)
POST {{baseURL}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "interest": "buying",
  "message": "I'm interested in luxury properties in Beverly Hills area. Looking for 3-4 bedroom homes with a budget around $2M.",
  "subscribeNewsletter": true
}

### Get User's Own Contacts
GET {{baseURL}}/contact/user?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Admin: Get All Contacts
GET {{baseURL}}/contact/admin/all?page=1&limit=10&status=new
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Admin: Get All Contacts with Search
GET {{baseURL}}/contact/admin/all?search=john&interest=buying
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Admin: Get Contact Statistics
GET {{baseURL}}/contact/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Admin: Get Contact By ID
GET {{baseURL}}/contact/admin/65f1b2c3d4e5f6789012345a
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Admin: Update Contact Status
PUT {{baseURL}}/contact/admin/65f1b2c3d4e5f6789012345a
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "status": "replied",
  "adminNotes": "Replied via email with property listings in Beverly Hills."
}

### Admin: Close Contact
PUT {{baseURL}}/contact/admin/65f1b2c3d4e5f6789012345a
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "status": "closed",
  "adminNotes": "Client found suitable property through agent referral."
}

### Admin: Delete Contact
DELETE {{baseURL}}/contact/admin/65f1b2c3d4e5f6789012345a
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Test Contact Form Submission with All Fields
POST {{baseURL}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Sarah",
  "lastName": "Johnson",
  "email": "sarah.johnson@example.com",
  "phone": "+1987654321",
  "interest": "selling",
  "message": "I need to sell my property at 123 Main St. It's a 4BR/3BA house built in 2010. Looking for a quick sale within 60 days.",
  "subscribeNewsletter": false
}

### Test Contact Form Submission (Minimal Required Fields)
POST {{baseURL}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Mike",
  "lastName": "Wilson",
  "email": "mike.wilson@example.com",
  "message": "Interested in investment properties. Please contact me."
}